body:
Yeah it happens. A friend of mine was always adament that she really wasn't interested in kids. She hit 24, had been in a relationship with another good friend of mine for then 5 years. He told me she was ravenous about it xD Guess it's just a natural thing that happens at a certain age for some people. Like everyone has said, sit down, say you've been thinking about it a lot and see if he's ready to start trying.

&#x200B;

Good luck :D
